un-tests.mjs --ac` 按文件内容里的 `[AC-xxx]` 子串筛文件）。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":161,"content":"| `test/unit/pools.test.mjs` | AC-015、AC-016 | quota-shapes 金标 9 例（经 `buildForecast`，`samples` 与 `usage` 取自金标）；b44 金标 9 例（经 `remainingForModels`）；`normalizeQuota` 五种形状直测 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":168,"content":"## 5. 追踪分片 `test/traceability/T-006.json`","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":172,"content":"  \"task\": \"T-006\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":175,"content":"    { \"ac\": \"AC-015\", \"status\": \"covered\", \"files\": [\"test/unit/pools.test.mjs\"] },","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":184,"content":"格式与 `test/traceability/T-004.json` 一致；不得出现 `baseline` 键；只列属主为 T-006 的 AC。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":191,"content":"4. 写 `test/traceability/T-006.json`。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":202,"content":"brief 的产出清单要求「defects/a1-quota 的预测部分 [fixed]」，但 brief 与任务图给 T-006 的 write_scope 都不含 `test/characterization/defects/a1-quota.test.mjs`（该文件当前只有 `[repro]` 段，`defects.json` 里 `a1-quota` 的属主是 T-006、对应 AC-015）。`scripts/check-defects.mjs` 在 AC-015 被追踪分片标为 covered 之后，会因缺少 `[fixed]` 段报 `defects.missing_fixed a1-quota`，进而让 `check-fast` 失败。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":204,"content":"- 默认处理（等人类批准）：把 `test/characterization/defects/a1-quota.test.mjs` 加入 write_scope，**只追加**一个标题以 `[fixed]` 开头的 `test()`，不得改动 `[repro]` 块（`defects.json` 里有该块的 sha256）。`[fixed]` 用例用 `buildForecast` 对 live lib 断言：`{ remaining_pct: 5 }` 加 3 个样本得到 `remaining_fraction: 0.05`、`risk: 'low_reserve'`、`risk_basis: 'fraction'`；`{ remaining: 1, unit: 'credits' }` 得到 `reason: 'credits_conversion_missing'`。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":".collab/tasks/004/design.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":3,"content":"write_scope:","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":31,"content":"本任务把蓝图 interfaces 第 1～17 节中的契约一次性转写成仓库内文件。转写完成后，仓库任何文件都不再引用蓝图目录。下游任务（T-006、T-014、T-022、T-024、T-028 等）只读本任务产出，不改。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":42,"content":"- 本任务不改 `package.json`（不在 write_scope）。`npm run snapshot:update` 仍指向 `run-tests --update-snapshots`，本任务的快照更新入口是 `node scripts/snapshot-update.mjs`。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":322,"content":"- 登记检查（始终执行）：`contracts/spec/**`、`contracts/golden/**` 下存在但 manifest 未登记的文件（manifest 自身除外）→ `FAIL write_scope.unregistered <path>`。manifest 不存在则 `FAIL write_scope.manifest_missing`。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":323,"content":"- 范围检查（给了 `--scope` 或 `--scope-from` 时执行，此时必须同时给 `--base`，否则 exit 2）：变更集 = `git diff --name-only --no-renames <base>`（含已提交、已暂存、未暂存的跟踪文件变更）并上 `git ls-files --others --exclude-standard`（未跟踪、未忽略文件）。每个变更路径若不匹配任何范围 glob → `FAIL write_scope.outside <path>`。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":326,"content":"- `--scope-from`：读取 markdown 开头的 YAML front matter（以 `---` 行开始和结束），解析其中 `write_scope:` 下的 `- <glob>` 列表项（只需支持这一种写法）；解析不出任何 glob 则 exit 2。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":439,"content":"### 9.2 `contracts/golden/quota-shapes.json`（kind `quota-shapes`，AC-015）","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":669,"content":"| | `[AC-073] check-write-scope reads write_scope from markdown front matter` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":695,"content":"- 标题 43：临时 root 带合法 manifest，新增一个 `contracts/spec/x.json` → `FAIL write_scope.unregistered contracts/spec/x.json`，exit 1。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":".collab/tasks/003/design.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":2,"content":"write_scope:","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":48,"content":"`lib/select.mjs` 不在 write_scope，保持原样；它不含 fs、child_process、时间或定时器，所以不影响 check-seams。它内部三处 `forecast(...)` 调用没有传 `now`，这一点由 T-007 处理；本任务靠 `forecast.mjs` 的默认值 `systemNow()` 保持行为不变。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":".collab/tasks/002/design.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":3,"content":"write_scope:","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":8,"content":"  - test/characterization/defects/a1-quota.test.mjs","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":32,"content":"- 本机 `core.autocrlf=true`：工作树文件是 CRLF，git 里是 LF，仓库没有 `.gitattributes`，且 `.gitattributes` 不在 write_scope。所以所有 sha256 一律在「CRLF 全部替换为 LF」之后计算（见 §2）。不要用 `git show` 往 PowerShell 管道里取内容，会被按文本解码。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":121,"content":"| a1-quota | T-006 | M1 | AC-015 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":133,"content":"a1-quota 在蓝图里写成「T-006/T-007」两个属主，但校验器要求单个 `T-\\d{3}`，这里取 T-006 / AC-015（draft 部分由 T-007 另补 [fixed]，不影响本账本）。数组顺序按上表。`a3-runner` 的文件由 T-001 持有、不在本任务写域，只登记它的 `repro_sha256`，不修改文件。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":162,"content":"| a1-quota | `forecast({records:[3 条同一 model、at 在 now 前 1 小时内、cost_usd 0.5], model, quota:{remaining_pct:5}, now})` 的 `risk==='unknown'`、`tasks_left===null`，且结果没有 `remaining_fraction`、`risk_basis` 键；`quota:{remaining:1, unit:'credits'}` 同样 `unknown` 且没有 `reason` 键 | overlay `lib/forecast.mjs`：识别 `remaining_pct`，输出 `remaining_fraction` 与 `risk:'low_reserve'` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":".collab/tasks/001/design.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":4,"content":"write_scope:","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":46,"content":"- `.gitignore` 只忽略 `config/cliworker.local.json`、`usage.jsonl`、`node_modules/`、`.collab/worktrees/`，而且不在 write_scope 内，**不能改**。因此运行器的产物（files-executed.json、skips.jsonl）默认不能写进仓库目录，见 §3.4。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":217,"content":"AC-015 T-006 unit                 AC-052 T-022 unit","contentTruncated":