ineNumber":540,"content":"      \"text\": \"权威规格自包含且可判据（F-02 加强）：contracts/registry.snapshot.json、contracts/spec/*.json、contracts/golden/** 均被 git 跟踪（git ls-files 列出）并通过各自 schema 校验；contracts/spec/** 与 contracts/golden/** 由 contracts/golden/manifest.json 逐文件登记 sha256，check-golden-frozen 在任一文件增删改时失败，且该检查已纳入 check-fast；check-write-scope 报出登记清单之外的 golden/spec 文件，以及落在任务 write_scope 之外的变更。例外：contracts/registry.snapshot.json 不做哈希冻结，只做 snapshot_version 递增 + compareRegistry 语义比较，v0.1 副本仅作回归夹具；该例外优先于任何字面冻结要求。check-no-collab 对 lib、scripts、test、contracts、docs、package.json 报告 0 处 .collab 引用，对 test/fixtures/no-collab 下的违规样例报出；gen-contract-doc 重新生成的 docs/contract.md 与已提交版本逐字节一致；registry.snapshot.json 含 interfaces 第 5 节的全部码、触发、阈值、原因、映射与 semantic_change。\",\r [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":608,"content":"      \"write_scope\": [","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":677,"content":"      \"write_scope\": [","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":682,"content":"        \"test/characterization/defects/a1-quota.test.mjs\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":740,"content":"      \"write_scope\": [","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":803,"content":"      \"write_scope\": [","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":872,"content":"      \"write_scope\": [","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":907,"content":"      \"id\": \"T-006\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":918,"content":"        \"defects/a1-quota 的预测部分 [fixed]\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":925,"content":"      \"write_scope\": [","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":932,"content":"        \"test/traceability/T-006.json\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":935,"content":"        \"AC-015\",","contentTruncate