回 E_LEVEL_UNKNOWN；count 取 1..10，默认 1；usage 取 Heavy/Normal/Light，默认 Normal；importance 取 normal/high，默认 normal，其他值返回 E_REQUEST_INVALID；未知字段给 W_FIELD_IGNORED:{field}；tier 是 level 的别名，给 W_FIELD_DEPRECATED。draft 视图：不带 schema 或带 compat:'draft' 时得到 draft 视图并带 W_DRAFT_DEPRECATED，0.3.0 移除；CLI 允许 draft，HTTP 上 draft 与 view:'full' 都需要有效会话，否则返回 403 E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN；CLI 的 models select 带 view:'full' 返回 E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN，完整视图只在 admin select。【2 ModelSelection v1（AgentLine 视图）】成功：{schema:'cliworker.selection/v1', ok:true, request_id:'r-001', level:'Top', usage:'He [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":".collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/design.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":53,"content":"| F-02 | 规格与金标入库，snapshot 自包含，禁止引用 `.collab` | T-004、AC-073；AC-015/016/017/051 改为读 `contracts/golden` |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":110,"content":"| `contracts/golden/quota-shapes.json` | 四种额度形状 | AC-015 |","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":120,"content":"- 金标由 T-004 一次写定，后续任务的 write_scope 不包含 `contracts/golden`。要改金标只能走蓝图变更，并递增 snapshot_version。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":143,"content":"- M1：a1-quota（T-006/T-007）、a2-pack（T-009）、a3-runner（T-001）、a4-paths、a4-null-config（T-005）、a5-dup-call、a5-forecast-x3、a5-unused（T-007）、a5-ignored-fields（T-008）。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":227,"content":"- 额度与预测公式：T-006 在 M1 定稿为纯函数，金标在 `contracts/golden`。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]}],"totalLines":96,"totalMatchedLines":96,"clientTruncated":false,"ripgrepTruncated":false}}}}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-e9babd0a-1205-48bc-b0e6-ebd7468e3f7d-9\nfc_d9cb9fa1-6843-9e07-92b3-762f1b62ad0c_1","startedAtMs":"1794076179978","completedAtMs":"1794076180396"},"model_call_id":"6eee2667-625b-41c4-b449-c94ee3fbbfde-2-ekrq","session_id":"8b0c7e00-33b7-4132-af53-4d244a6a9e2f","timestamp_ms":1794076180678}
