{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-e2209097-6950-418d-b47e-44cc2132cf75-16\nfc_b096c053-3885-9624-9b94-80ef7abd24b0_0","tool_call":{"readToolCall":{"args":{"path":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/worktrees/006/scripts/check-fast.mjs","limit":80},"result":{"success":{"content":"#!/usr/bin/env node\n// Runs every scripts/check-*.mjs in code point order (never itself) and then the full test run.\nimport fs from 'node:fs'\nimport path from 'node:path'\nimport { spawnSync } from 'node:child_process'\nimport { fileURLToPath } from 'node:url'\n\nconst HERE = path.dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url))\nconst STEP_PATTERN = /^check-.*\\.mjs$/\nconst SELF = 'check-fast.mjs'\n\nfunction out(text) {\n  fs.writeSync(1, text)\n}\n\nfunction err(text) {\n  fs.writeSync(2, text)\n}\n\nfunction byCodePoint(a, b) {\n  if (a < b) return -1\n  if (a > b) return 1\n  return 0\n}\n\nfunction stepFailed(label, result) {\n  const code = result.status === null ? 1 : result.status\n  err(`check-fast: FAILED step ${label} (exit ${code})\\n`)\n  process.exitCode = code\n}\n\nfunction main() {\n  const injected = Boolean(process.env.CLIWORKER_TEST_CHECK_DIR || process.env.CLIWORKER_TEST_FINAL_SCRIPT)\n  const dir = process.env.CLIWORKER_TEST_CHECK_DIR\n    ? path.resolve(process.env.CLIWORKER_TEST_CHECK_DIR)\n    : HERE\n  const finalScript = process.env.CLIWORKER_TEST_FINAL_SCRIPT\n    ? path.resolve(process.env.CLIWORKER_TEST_FINAL_SCRIPT)\n    : path.join(dir, 'run-tests.mjs')\n  const cwd = path.dirname(dir)\n\n  if (injected) err('check-fast: test injection active\\n')\n\n  let names = []\n  try {\n    names = fs.readdirSync(dir)\n  } catch {\n    names = []\n  }\n\n  const steps = names\n    .filter((name) => STEP_PATTERN.test(name) && name !== SELF)\n    .filter((name) => {\n      try {\n        return fs.statSync(path.join(dir, name)).isFile()\n      } catch {\n        return false\n      }\n    })\n    .sort(byCodePoint)\n\n  for (const name of steps) {\n    out(`==> ${name}\\n`)\n    const result = spawnSync(process.execPath, [path.join(dir, name)], { cwd, stdio: 'inherit' })\n    if (result.status !== 0) {\n      stepFailed(name, result)\n      return\n    }\n  }\n\n  out('==> npm test\\n')\n  const result = spawnSync(process.execPath, [finalScript], { cwd, stdio: 'inherit' })\n  if (result.status !== 0) {\n    stepFailed('npm test', result)\n    return\n  }\n\n  out('check-fast: ok\\n')\n  process.exitCode = 0\n}","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":83,"fileSize":2169,"path":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/worktrees/006/scripts/check-fast.mjs","readRange":{"startLine":1,"endLine":80},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-e2209097-6950-418d-b47e-44cc2132cf75-16\nfc_b096c053-3885-9624-9b94-80ef7abd24b0_0","startedAtMs":"1794076210652","completedAtMs":"1794076210881"},"model_call_id":"6eee2667-625b-41c4-b449-c94ee3fbbfde-5-7gom","session_id":"8b0c7e00-33b7-4132-af53-4d244a6a9e2f","timestamp_ms":1794076211089}
{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-e2209097-6950-418d-b47e-44cc2132cf75-19\nfc_b096c053-3885-9624-9b94-80ef7abd24b0_3","tool_call":{"readToolCall":{"args":{"path":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/worktrees/006/.collab/tasks/003/acceptance.md","limit":80},"result":{"success":{"content":"# Task 003 验收标准\n\n规格见同目录 `design.md`。基准提交是 `7f655f7`：在该提交上 `node scripts/check-fast.mjs` 通过，`node scripts/check-traceability.mjs` 输出 `check-traceability: ok (covered=6 planned=68)`。\n\n## 约定\n\n- 所有命令在仓库根（任务 worktree 根）执行，Node 20+，bash 与 pwsh 7 下都能原样运行。\n- `node --input-type=module -e \"…\"` 探针的 JS 只用单引号、不含 `$`、反引号、反斜杠和双引号，这样两种 shell 下引号行为一致。探针通过时 stdout 恰好是一行 `PROBE-OK <标签>`，退出码 0；失败时抛错或 `process.exit(1)`，stdout 没有 `PROBE-OK`。\n- “run-tests 通过”指：退出码 0；stdout 含 `ℹ fail 0`；含至少一行以 `✔ [AC-xxx]` 开头的测试；不含 `FAIL run.no_match`、`FAIL discovery`。\n- 每条命令独立判定，不依赖前一条的副作用。\n\n## AC-006 import-safe 入口\n\n**V-006-1 自带测试通过**\n\n```\nnode scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-006\n```\n\n期望：run-tests 通过，且 `✔ [AC-006]` 行至少 3 条；末行为 `run-tests: filtered <n> files, manifest …`，其中 `n >= 1`。\n\n**V-006-2 子进程 import 无输出**\n\n```\nnode --input-type=module -e \"import { spawnSync } from 'node:child_process'; import { pathToFileURL } from 'node:url'; import path from 'node:path'; for (const f of ['lib/cli.mjs', 'lib/index.js']) { const u = pathToFileURL(path.resolve(f)).href; const r = spawnSync(process.execPath, ['--input-type=module', '-e', 'await import(process.argv[1])', u], { encoding: 'utf8' }); if (r.status !== 0 || r.stdout.length !== 0 || r.stderr.length !== 0) { console.error(f, r.status, r.stdout.length, r.stderr.length); process.exit(1) } } console.log('PROBE-OK import-safe')\"\n```\n\n期望：stdout 为 `PROBE-OK import-safe`，退出码 0。（基准提交上 `lib/cli.mjs` 一导入就执行 `main` 并 `process.exit`，此探针会失败。）\n\n**V-006-3 `main(argv, ctx)` 返回 `{exitCode}`，输出进 `ctx.stdout`**\n\n```\nnode --input-type=module -e \"import { main } from './lib/cli.mjs'; import { createFakeContext } from './test/helpers/ctx.mjs'; const cfg = JSON.stringify({ providers: { p1: { cli: 'p1cli' } }, models: {} }); const ctx = createFakeContext({ files: { '/cw/config.json': cfg }, exec: () => ({ ok: true, code: 0, stdout: 'v 1.2.3', stderr: '', error: null }) }); const r = await main(['providers', '--config', '/cw/config.json'], ctx); const j = JSON.parse(ctx.stdout.text()); if (Object.keys(r).join() !== 'exitCode' || r.exitCode !== 0) throw new Error('result ' + JSON.stringify(r)); if (j.schema !== 'cliworker.providers/v1' || j.providers.length !== 1 || j.providers[0].id !== 'p1' || j.providers[0].state !== 'callable' || j.providers[0].version !== '1.2.3') throw new Error('stdout ' + ctx.stdout.text()); if (ctx.stderr.text() !== '' || ctx.exec.count < 1) throw new Error('stderr/exec'); console.log('PROBE-OK main-ctx')\"\n```\n\n期望：stdout 为 `PROBE-OK main-ctx`，退出码 0。\n\n**V-006-4 迁入的命令行为不变（models list、usage record/summary、models forecast）**\n\n```\nnode --input-type=module -e \"import path from 'node:path'; import { main } from './lib/cli.mjs'; import { createFakeContext } from './test/helpers/ctx.mjs'; const cfg = JSON.stringify({ providers: { p1: { cli: 'p1cli', readonly: true } }, models: { m1: { provider: 'p1', id: 'm1', tier: 'top', identity: 'verified', vendor: 'v', prices: { input_per_mtok: 1000, output_per_mtok: 0 } } } }); const mk = () => createFakeContext({ files: { '/cw/config.json': cfg }, env: { CLIWORKER_HOME: '/cw/home' }, now: Date.parse('2020-01-01T00:00:00Z'), exec: () => ({ ok: true, code: 0, stdout: '1.2.3', stderr: '', error: null }) }); const c1 = mk(); const r1 = await main(['models', 'list', '--config', '/cw/config.json'], c1); const l = JSON.parse(c1.stdout.text()); if (r1.exitCode !== 0 || l.schema !== 'cliworker.models/v1' || l.models.length !== 1 || l.models[0].key !== 'm1' || l.models[0].callable !== true || l.models[0].level !== 'Top') throw new Error('list ' + c1.stdout.text()); const c2 = mk(); const r2 = await main(['usage', 'record', '--json', JSON.stringify({ model: 'm1', input_tokens: 1000, output_tokens: 0 }), '--config', '/cw/config.json'], c2); const rec = JSON.parse(c2.stdout.text()); if (r2.exitCode !== 0 || rec.schema !== 'cliworker.usage/v1' || rec.ok !== true || rec.recorded.at !== '2020-01-01T00:00:00.000Z' || rec.recorded.cost_usd !== 1) throw new Error('record ' + c2.stdout.text()); const lines = c2.fs.readFileSync(path.resolve('/cw/home/usage.jsonl'), 'utf8').split(String.fromCharCode(10)).filter(Boolean); if (lines.length !== 1 || JSON.parse(lines[0]).model !== 'm1') throw new Error('usage file'); const n = c2.stdout.text().length; const r3 = await main(['usage', 'summary', '--config', '/cw/config.json'], c2); const sum = JSON.parse(c2.stdout.text().slice(n)); if (r3.exitCode !== 0 || sum.schema !== 'cliworker.usage/v1' || sum.records.length !== 1) throw new Error('summary'); const n2 = c2.stdout.text().length; const r4 = await main(['models', 'forecast', '--model', 'm1', '--config', '/cw/config.json'], c2); const fc = JSON.parse(c2.stdout.text().slice(n2)); if (r4.exitCode !== 0 || fc.schema !== 'cliworker.forecast/v1' || fc.forecast.status !== 'known' || fc.forecast.burn_per_hour !== 60) throw new Error('forecast ' + JSON.stringify(fc)); console.log('PROBE-OK commands')\"\n```\n\n期望：stdout 为 `PROBE-OK commands`，退出码 0。`burn_per_hour` 为 60 说明 forecast 用的是 `ctx.now()`（伪时钟等于样本时间），不是系统时间。\n\n**V-006-5 错误路径不退出进程，只写 stderr**\n\n```\nnode --input-type=module -e \"import { main } from './lib/cli.mjs'; import { createFakeContext } from './test/helpers/ctx.mjs'; const a = createFakeContext(); const ra = await main([], a); const b = createFakeContext(); const rb = await main(['providers', '--config', '/missing/config.json'], b); if (ra.exitCode !== 1 || a.stdout.text() !== '' || a.stderr.text().indexOf('ERROR: usage: cliworker') !== 0) throw new Error('usage ' + a.stderr.text()); if (rb.exitCode !== 1 || b.stdout.text() !== '' || b.stderr.text().indexOf('ERROR: cannot read CLIWorker config') !== 0) throw new Error('config ' + b.stderr.text()); console.log('PROBE-OK main-errors')\"\n```\n\n期望：stdout 为 `PROBE-OK main-errors`，退出码 0。\n\n**V-006-6 lib 下没有 `process.exit` 字样（含注释）**\n\n```\nnode --input-type=module -e \"import fs from 'node:fs'; import path from 'node:path'; const hits = []; const walk = (d) => { for (const e of fs.readdirSync(d, { withFileTypes: true })) { const p = path.join(d, e.name); if (e.isDirectory()) walk(p); else if (/[.](mjs|js|cjs)$/.test(p) && fs.readFileSync(p, 'utf8').includes('process.exit')) hits.push(p) } }; walk('lib'); if (hits.length) { console.error(hits); process.exit(1) } console.log('PROBE-OK no-process-exit')\"\n```\n\n期望：stdout 为 `PROBE-OK no-process-exit`，退出码 0。\n\n**V-006-7 bin 入口是薄封装**\n\n```\nnode bin/cliworker.mjs\n```\n\n期望：退出码 1；stdout 为空；stderr 以 `ERROR: usage: cliworker providers | models list|select|forecast | usage record|summary` 开头。\n\n## AC-007 缝规则与 check-seams\n\n**V-007-1 自带测试通过**\n\n```\nnode scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-007\n```\n\n期望：run-tests 通过，`✔ [AC-007]` 行至少 3 条。\n\n**V-007-2 真实 lib 通过**","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":285,"fileSize":32717,"path":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/worktrees/006/.collab/tasks/003/acceptance.md","readRange":{"startLine":1,"endLine":80},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-e2209097-6950-418d-b47e-44cc2132cf75-19\nfc_b096c053-3885-9624-9b94-80ef7abd24b0_3","startedAtMs":"1794076210662","completedAtMs":"1794076210971"},"model_call_id":"6eee2667-625b-41c4-b449-c94ee3fbbfde-5-7gom","session_id":"8b0c7e00-33b7-4132-af53-4d244a6a9e2f","timestamp_ms":1794076211193}
{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-e2209097-6950-418d-b47e-44cc2132cf75-18\nfc_b096c053-3885-9624-9b94-80ef7abd24b0_2","tool_call":{"readToolCall":{"args":{"path":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/worktrees/006/.collab/tasks/002/design.md","offset":100,"limit":90},"result":{"success":{"content":"\n| id | 触发 |\n|---|---|\n| `frozen.manifest_missing` | `test/characterization/frozen-files.json` 不存在或不是合法 JSON |\n| `frozen.manifest_schema` | 缺 `files` 数组；`source_commit` 不是字符串 `f75bb76`；条目缺 `path`/`sha256` 或 sha256 不是 64 位小写十六进制；路径重复 |\n| `frozen.forbidden_path` | 规范化后的路径以 `lib/`、`bin/`、`config/` 开头（大小写不敏感）。detail 为该路径 |\n| `frozen.outside_allowed` | 路径不在允许集合内（含 `scripts/`、`package.json` 等）、是绝对路径、含 `..`、含反斜杠或盘符 |\n| `frozen.file_missing` | 已登记文件在磁盘上不存在 |\n| `frozen.hash_mismatch` | 按 §2 口径算出的 sha256 与登记值不同 |\n| `frozen.unregistered` | 副本目录 `test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/` 下有未登记的文件，或 `test/characterization/stable.test.mjs` 未登记 |\n\n允许集合（硬编码在脚本里）：前缀 `test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/`、精确路径 `test/characterization/stable.test.mjs`、前缀 `contracts/spec/`、前缀 `contracts/golden/`。判定顺序：先规范化（`\\`→ 视为非法，`path.posix.normalize`），再判 `forbidden_path`，再判 `outside_allowed`，其余才去读文件。不调用 git，不读网络。\n\n## 5. 缺陷账本、[repro] 段与 canary\n\n### 5.1 defects.json\n\n11 条，字段 `{id, owner_task, owner_milestone, ac, repro_sha256}`。`repro_sha256` 是本设计为 AC-005「每条 [repro] 段的 sha256」新增的字段，不属于 interfaces 第 15 节原文；`check-defects` 现有校验对多余字段不敏感，T-001 的夹具（不带该字段）继续有效。\n\n| id | owner_task | owner_milestone | ac |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| a1-quota | T-006 | M1 | AC-015 |\n| a2-pack | T-009 | M1 | AC-025 |\n| a3-runner | T-001 | M1 | AC-001 |\n| a4-paths | T-005 | M1 | AC-012 |\n| a4-null-config | T-005 | M1 | AC-014 |\n| a5-dup-call | T-007 | M1 | AC-020 |\n| a5-forecast-x3 | T-007 | M1 | AC-020 |\n| a5-unused | T-007 | M1 | AC-022 |\n| a5-ignored-fields | T-008 | M1 | AC-024 |\n| a5-shell | T-010 | M2 | AC-026 |\n| a5-nocache | T-022 | M4 | AC-055 |\n\na1-quota 在蓝图里写成「T-006/T-007」两个属主，但校验器要求单个 `T-\\d{3}`，这里取 T-006 / AC-015（draft 部分由 T-007 另补 [fixed]，不影响本账本）。数组顺序按上表。`a3-runner` 的文件由 T-001 持有、不在本任务写域，只登记它的 `repro_sha256`，不修改文件。\n\n### 5.2 [repro] 段的格式与 sha256\n\n为让「段」可机器识别，且后续任务在同一文件里追加 `[fixed]` 不会改动已登记的哈希，约定：\n\n- 一个 `[repro]` 块 = 文件中**行首无缩进**、以 `test('[repro]` 或 `test(\"[repro]` 开头且该行以 `{` 结尾的那一行，到其后第一个行首为 `})` 的行（含）。不允许单行写法。\n- 段文本 = 文件中全部 [repro] 块（按出现顺序），每块先把 CRLF 换成 LF，块之间用 `\\n` 连接；`repro_sha256 = sha256(段文本的 UTF-8)`。块之外的内容（import、常量、辅助函数、`[fixed]` 块）不进哈希。\n- [repro] 块与 [fixed] 块在不同的 `test()` 里，标题分别以 `[repro]`、`[fixed]` 开头（`hasFixedSection` 已按此识别）。\n- 本任务写的 10 个 [repro] 标题形如 `[repro] [AC-005] <说明>`，这样 `run-tests --ac AC-005` 会直接运行它们；每个块**自包含**（需要的常量、夹具、清理都写在块里）。\n- 在 `scripts/check-defects.mjs` 里导出 `extractReproSection(source)` 和 `reproSha256(source)`，实现者用它们生成登记值；同一个函数被检查使用，保证口径唯一。\n\n### 5.3 [repro] 对副本的访问方式\n\n所有 repro 文件在块外定义：\n\n```js\nconst V01 = process.env.CLIWORKER_V01_ROOT\n  ?? fileURLToPath(new URL('../../fixtures/characterization/v0.1/', import.meta.url))\n```\n\n块内用 `await import(pathToFileURL(path.join(V01, 'lib', 'select.mjs')).href)` 动态导入副本，不要静态导入、不要用 `import.meta.url` 之外的位置推断。这是 canary 能把同一个 repro 指向「已修复变体」的前提。\n\n### 5.4 各缺陷的 [repro] 断言与 canary\n\nrepro 断言的是 **0.1 副本里缺陷存在**（所以在副本上通过）。canary 的覆盖文件是 0.1 副本的「最小已修复变体」，repro 在其上必须失败。\n\n| id | [repro] 断言（在 0.1 副本上） | canary |\n|---|---|---|\n| a1-quota | `forecast({records:[3 条同一 model、at 在 now 前 1 小时内、cost_usd 0.5], model, quota:{remaining_pct:5}, now})` 的 `risk==='unknown'`、`tasks_left===null`，且结果没有 `remaining_fraction`、`risk_basis` 键；`quota:{remaining:1, unit:'credits'}` 同样 `unknown` 且没有 `reason` 键 | overlay `lib/forecast.mjs`：识别 `remaining_pct`，输出 `remaining_fraction` 与 `risk:'low_reserve'` |\n| a2-pack | 块外内联 `V01_PACKAGE = { bin: null, files: ['lib','cordis.patch.yml','dsh.plugin.json','README.md'] }`（f75bb76 的 package.json 形状；副本不含 package.json，沿用 a3-runner 的做法）。断言 `bin===null`，`files` 不含 `bin`、`config`，且副本里存在 `config/cliworker.example.json`（说明示例存在但不会随包发布） | `repro_edits`：把 `bin: null` 改成 `bin: 'bin/cliworker.mjs'` |\n| a3-runner | 沿用 T-001 已写好的 [repro]，不改 | `repro_edits`：把 `scripts: null,` 改成 `scripts: { test: 'node scripts/run-tests.mjs' },` |\n| a4-paths | 用 `os.tmpdir()` 下的两个临时目录各写一个 `{providers:{},models:{}}` 配置，设置 `CLIWORKER_HOME` 为第三个临时目录；`loadConfig` 两份得到的 `_home` 相同，且都不在各自配置文件所在目录之下（块内 try/finally 还原环境变量并清理） | overlay `lib/config.mjs`：`_home` 取配置文件所在目录下的 `state` |\n| a4-null-config | 配置文件内容为 `null` 时，`loadConfig` 抛出的是 `TypeError` 且 `error.code===undefined`；内容为 `{}` 时抛出的 Error 的 `code===undefined` | overlay `lib/config.mjs`：所有 throw 都带 `code='E_CONFIG'`，并避免对 null 取属性 |\n| a5-dup-call | 一个可调用、已验证的 Quick 模型：`selectModels` 的入选 handle 同时有 `cli` 和 `call` 两个键，且 `deepEqual(h.cli, h.call)` | overlay `lib/select.mjs`：去掉 `cli: call` |\n| a5-forecast-x3 | 同一 provider 下 12 个都通过前置过滤的模型；`config.quotas` 用 Proxy 统计对 provider 键的 `get` 次数（每次 forecast 调用恰好读一次）。断言次数 **大于 12**（0.1 在过滤、排序比较器、入选三处各算一遍） | overlay `lib/select.mjs`：按模型 key 记忆化，且 handle 的 `quota` 也复用同一次读取，使次数恰好等于 12 |\n| a5-unused | 读副本源码：`lib/select.mjs` 中 `isObject` 只出现 1 次（即声明处）；`lib/cli.mjs` 有 `import fs from` 但不存在 `fs.` 的使用 | overlay `lib/select.mjs`（删 `isObject`）与 `lib/cli.mjs`（删 `fs` 导入） |\n| a5-ignored-fields | `selectModels(config,{level:'Quick', role:'dev', importance:'high'})` 返回的结果 `ok===true`，且 `'warnings' in result === false` | overlay `lib/select.mjs`：返回 `warnings:[{code:'W_FIELD_IGNORED', field:'role'}]` |\n| a5-shell | 读副本 `lib/availability.mjs` 源码，匹配 `/shell:\\s*process\\.platform\\s*===\\s*'win32'/` | overlay `lib/availability.mjs`：改为 `shell: false` |\n| a5-nocache | 临时目录里写 `probe.mjs`（向环境变量 `CLIWORKER_TEST_PROBE_FILE` 指向的文件追加一个字符并打印 `node 1.0.0`），`process.chdir` 到该目录，provider 为 `{cli:'node', version_args:['probe.mjs']}`（无 auth_args），连续两次 `providerStatus(config)`，断言探测文件长度为 2（没有缓存，每次都真的起进程）；finally 里还原 cwd 与环境变量并清理 | overlay `lib/availability.mjs`：对同一 provider 配置缓存状态，使长度为 1 |\n\na5-nocache 里用 `cli:'node'` 加相对脚本名，是为了绕开 0.1 在 win32 上 `shell:true` 对带空格路径的拆分（那正是 a5-shell 的缺陷）。\n\n### 5.5 canary 目录与格式\n\n`test/characterization/canary/<id>/canary.json`：\n\n```json\n{ \"defect\": \"a5-dup-call\", \"repro_edits\": [ { \"find\": \"...\", \"replace\": \"...\" } ] }\n```\n\n- `defect` 必须等于目录名；`repro_edits` 可省略。\n- 覆盖文件放在 `canary/<id>/overlay/` 下，路径相对 v0.1 根（如 `overlay/lib/select.mjs`）；这些文件是 0.1 副本的完整修改版，**扩展名保持 `.mjs`/`.js`，但不得叫 `*.test.mjs`**。\n- 每个 canary 至少有一个 overlay 文件或一条 `repro_edits`，否则 `defects.canary_missing`。a3-runner 与 a2-pack 只用 `repro_edits`（它们的 repro 断言内联常量，无法通过副本变体改变）。\n- `repro_edits[].find` 必须在 repro 测试文件源码中**恰好出现一次**，否则 `defects.canary_error`。\n\n### 5.6 check-defects 的追加行为","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":271,"fileSize":24644,"path":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/worktrees/006/.collab/tasks/002/design.md","readRange":{"startLine":100,"endLine":189},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-e2209097-6950-418d-b47e-44cc2132cf75-18\nfc_b096c053-3885-9624-9b94-80ef7abd24b0_2","startedAtMs":"1794076210659","completedAtMs":"1794076210973"},"model_call_id":"6eee2667-625b-41c4-b449-c94ee3fbbfde-5-7gom","session_id":"8b0c7e00-33b7-4132-af53-4d244a6a9e2f","timestamp_ms":1794076211194}
