{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-9a2f85c1-3469-4553-a12b-56c543087da8-22\nfc_f2c4390b-c627-951f-9de0-3e41948448f7_2","tool_call":{"readToolCall":{"args":{"path":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/worktrees/006/.collab/tasks/002/acceptance.md","limit":40},"result":{"success":{"content":"# T-002 验收标准\n\n对应 AC-005（levels: unit）。所有命令在仓库根（`C:\\git\\dsh-CLIWorker\\.collab\\worktrees\\002`）用 `pwsh -NoProfile` 执行，Node ≥ 20。基准提交：`f75bb76`（0.1 副本的来源）。brief 没有给出既有验收报告路径。\n\n格式约定（与 `ci-runner.ps1` 的解析规则一致）：每个用例是一个 `### <编号> <标题>` 小节，编号形如 `A1`、`B3`、`D4`（字母 + 数字），小节下只有一个 ```powershell 代码块且其首行就是可执行命令；断言写成紧随其后的项目符号。每个脚本在全部断言成立时打印 `<编号> OK` 并以退出码 0 结束，否则以非 0 退出。脚本自包含，不依赖任何前置小节定义的函数或变量。\n\n## 1. 总入口\n\n### A1 过滤运行 AC-005\n\n```powershell\n$out = (node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-005 2>&1 | Out-String)\n$code = $LASTEXITCODE\nif ($code -ne 0) { throw \"run-tests --ac AC-005 exited $code\" }\nif ($out -notmatch 'run-tests: filtered ') { throw 'stdout is missing run-tests: filtered' }\nif ($out.Contains('FAIL')) { throw 'stdout contains FAIL' }\n$cross = [string][char]0x2716\nif ($out.Contains($cross)) { throw 'stdout contains the failure mark' }\n$titles = @(\n  '[AC-005] stable: deprecated models are never candidates',\n  '[AC-005] stable: unverified identity is rejected unless require_verified is false',\n  '[AC-005] stable: level filter rejects other levels',\n  '[AC-005] stable: exclude wins and reports excluded',\n  '[AC-005] stable: the four schema names',\n  '[AC-005] stable: imports only the v0.1 copy',\n  '[AC-005] frozen: untouched fixture root passes',\n  '[AC-005] frozen: changing one registered byte fails with frozen.hash_mismatch',\n  '[AC-005] frozen: CRLF checkout of a registered file still passes',\n  '[AC-005] frozen: lib/, bin/ and config/ paths are rejected as frozen.forbidden_path',\n  '[AC-005] frozen: scripts/ and other unlisted paths fail with frozen.outside_allowed',\n  '[AC-005] frozen: contracts/spec and contracts/golden paths are allowed',\n  '[AC-005] frozen: unregistered file in the v0.1 copy fails with frozen.unregistered',\n  '[AC-005] frozen: missing registered file fails with frozen.file_missing',\n  '[AC-005] frozen: path traversal and absolute paths are rejected',\n  '[AC-005] defects: well-formed fixture ledger passes',\n  '[AC-005] defects: repro edited after registration fails with defects.repro_changed',\n  '[AC-005] defects: canary that still passes fails with defects.canary_survived',\n  '[AC-005] defects: missing canary fails with defects.canary_missing',\n  '[AC-005] defects: repro failing on the unmodified copy fails with defects.repro_baseline_failed',\n  '[AC-005] defects: a repro that cannot even load is not counted as a canary hit'","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":499,"fileSize":29243,"path":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/worktrees/006/.collab/tasks/002/acceptance.md","readRange":{"startLine":1,"endLine":40},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-9a2f85c1-3469-4553-a12b-56c543087da8-22\nfc_f2c4390b-c627-951f-9de0-3e41948448f7_2","startedAtMs":"1794076225718","completedAtMs":"1794076226201"},"model_call_id":"6eee2667-625b-41c4-b449-c94ee3fbbfde-6-6ri8","session_id":"8b0c7e00-33b7-4132-af53-4d244a6a9e2f","timestamp_ms":1794076226353}
{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-9a2f85c1-3469-4553-a12b-56c543087da8-23\nfc_f2c4390b-c627-951f-9de0-3e41948448f7_3","tool_call":{"grepToolCall":{"args":{"pattern":"AC-015|AC-016|AC-017|AC-018|AC-019","path":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/worktrees/006/.collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2","glob":"*.json","outputMode":"content","caseInsensitive":false,"multiline":false,"toolCallId":"call-9a2f85c1-3469-4553-a12b-56c543087da8-23\nfc_f2c4390b-c627-951f-9de0-3e41948448f7_3","offset":0},"result":{"success":{"pattern":"AC-015|AC-016|AC-017|AC-018|AC-019","path":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/worktrees/006/.collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2","outputMode":"content","workspaceResults":{"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/worktrees/006":{"content":{"matches":[{"file":".collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/testability.json","matches":[{"lineNumber":23,"content":"      \"text\": \"§4 规定金标由 T-004 一次写定、后续任务 write_scope 不含 contracts/golden、改金标须走蓝图变更并递增 snapshot_version；但 AC-073 只校验 git 跟踪 + 各自 schema + check-no-collab + docs/contract.md 逐字节一致，AC-010 的 compareRegistry 与 snapshot_version 递增只覆盖 registry.snapshot.json。没有任何对 contracts/golden/** 与 contracts/spec/** 的哈希清单或 check-golden-frozen 进入 check-fast，也没有检查器强制 write_scope。于是后续任务可静默改金标的 input 或 expected 让失败 AC「通过」，且无人能发现——正是金标驱动测试最典型的 oracle 漂移，会架空 AC-015/016/017/050/051 的全部深相等断言。需补一份随仓库提交的逐文件 sha256 冻结清单、一个纳入 check-fast 的校验器，并明确 snapshot_version 对全部规格文件（不仅是注册表）递增、以及 write_scope 由哪个 check 强制。\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":".collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/task-graph.json","matches":[{"lineNumber":128,"content":"      \"id\": \"AC-015\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":135,"content":"      \"id\": \"AC-016\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":142,"content":"      \"id\": \"AC-017\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":149,"content":"      \"id\": \"AC-018\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":156,"content":"      \"id\": \"AC-019\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":171,"content":"      \"text\": \"draft 视图在 usage 为 Heavy 时，用 AC-015 的金标输入，risk 为 exhausted、critical 或 low_reserve 的模型全部进入 rejected，原因为 E_FORECAST_EXHAUSTION；Normal 和 Light 不因此拒选。只断言拒选集合与原因，不断言排序。defects/a1-quota 的 [fixed] 部分通过。\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":935,"content":"        \"AC-015\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":936,"content":"        \"AC-016\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":937,"content":"        \"AC-017\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":938,"content":"        \"AC-018\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":939,"content":"        \"AC-019\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":942,"content":"        \"node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-015\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":943,"content":"        \"node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-016\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":944,"content":"        \"node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-017\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":945,"content":"        \"node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-018\",","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":946,"content":"        \"node scripts/run-tests.mjs --ac AC-019\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":".collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/review-v3.verdict.json","matches":[{"lineNumber":30,"content":"      \"text\": \"确认 TB-2（金标 oracle 可静默漂移）：§4 称金标由 T-004 一次写定、后续 write_scope 不含 contracts/golden、改动须走蓝图变更并递增 snapshot_version，但 AC-073 只校验 git 跟踪 + 各自 schema + check-no-collab + docs/contract.md 逐字节一致，AC-010 的 compareRegistry 与 snapshot_version 递增只覆盖 registry.snapshot.json；既无 contracts/golden/** 与 contracts/spec/** 的逐文件 sha256 冻结清单，也无 check-golden-frozen 纳入 check-fast，更无检查器强制 write_scope。后续任务可直接改金标 input/expected 让 AC-015/016/017/050/051 的深相等断言「通过」而无人察觉，正好架空 F-02 的权威规格入库。须补随仓库提交的逐文件哈希清单、纳入 check-fast 的校验器，明确 snapshot_version 对全部规格文件递增，并钉死由哪个 check 强制 write_scope。\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":66,"content":"      \"text\": \"已核验、核心处理成立：上一轮 8 条意见的核心机制均已在第三轮稿、任务图与验收矩阵实质落地——可推进时钟与 check-seams（AC-072、手段表）、自包含 registry.snapshot.json 与 contracts/spec+golden 入库（AC-073、AC-015/016/017/051 读金标、check-no-collab）、real-smoke 基线与 wsl-discover 步骤 ac 映射/豁免（AC-038/069/070）、只冻结 0.1 副本（AC-005）、M1 改名与 milestone-gate（AC-074）、单一 ac-index 与仅完整运行做集合比较（AC-001/004）、session/ui 例外与 csrf 随会话签发（AC-059/060）、trigger_id 唯一与 E_LOOPBACK_ONLY 及单码路由表（AC-009）。本轮 revise 仅针对 F-01..F-07 列举的新增残留/遗漏缺口，不是对整体修订的否定。\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":".collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/review-v1.verdict.json","matches":[{"lineNumber":42,"content":"      \"text\": \"墙钟阈值在 CI 不可复现且无 CI 承载双 Node（确认 TB-3/TB-4）。AC-017 的 N/4+1 秒、AC-018 的 p95<300ms 依赖机器负载，AC-042/013 并发若用 sleep 会 flaky；AC-001 要求 Node 20 与 22 双版本，但任务图无任何 CI 配置或任务。CI 断言应改为结构不变量（exec 计数 0、预留≤剩余、1000 行全可解析、request_id 重放幂等），绝对耗时移入独立 perf 作业且不作合并门禁；另需补 lockfile 与 CI 矩阵任务，并确认 pwsh 或给等价回退（AC-002/AC-055 的验收方向均假定 pwsh）。\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":78,"content":"      \"text\": \"累计型 harness 无单一归属，扫描器缺 canary（确认 TB-8）。AC-019 哨兵跨 T-009 到 T-019 到 T-020 增量构建，若各阶段各写局部扫描，后续不重跑全流程，HTTP 泄露会漏网；AC-043 递归扫描器若无「故意塞入 provider 字段必须被抓到」的元测试，自身失效不可见；check-docs（AC-053）与 smoke 报告（AC-055）应复用同一扫描器。另禁用词表含 cli，与强制包装命令里 cliworker 与 config 的子串冲突，AC-043 须定义扫描语义（字段名或整词匹配加包装器白名单），否则按字面无法满足。须指定一个共享 helper 拥有递归字节扫描（stdout、stderr、state_dir 全文件、audit、HTTP）与 env-only 非 argv 断言，并规定每里程碑重跑全流程。\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":84,"content":"      \"text\": \"跨平台跳过与发布门禁语义未定（确认 TB-5/TB-9/TB-10）。AC-016/024/020/029 在单 OS CI 无法原生跑，「跳过并记录原因」无结构化格式与基线平台，skip 可能与 pass 混淆；AC-055 依赖真机配置、凭据、DSH host 不可 CI 化，却要求每步 pass 或带原因 skip 且任何 fail 阻断发布，skip 是否阻断、由谁触发、报告脱敏如何机读验证均未定义，且 levels 含 smoke 却无 test/smoke/ 目录、无 fake-cli dry-run 让流水线执行。须拆全平台纯解析单测加平台门控原生用例、结构化 skip 清单永不满足发布门禁、建立 level 到目录映射与 AC 到测试文件 traceability 矩阵，并让 check-test-discovery 用集合相等（而非 AC-001 的「执行数与文件数一致」计数相等）校验。\"","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":".collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/review-v2.verdict.json","matches":[{"lineNumber":24,"content":"      \"text\": \"确认 TB-1：注入时钟必须是可推进/可设置的伪时钟，而 §4/T-003 只给『固定时钟』。已核对 §0.2『可替换 now』与 §4『固定时钟』只保证可替换、不保证可推进，但 AC-019（now>reset_at 后 used_fraction 归零）、AC-028（lock_wait_ms）、AC-029（lock_stale_ms）、AC-047（callable 过 TTL→availability_stale）、AC-049（reading_ttl_s→W_STALE_DATA）、AC-058（E_LEASE_EXPIRED）、AC-064（count=3 在注入时钟下顺序执行、三租约均不过期）以及 §0.6 的 expires_at=selected_at+lease_ttl_s+i×timeout_s，共 ≥8 条 AC 需在单进程内推进时间；设计又明令『用文件屏障代替 sleep』『注入时钟加屏障，不用 sleep』且 AC-028 不断言墙钟时间。固定时钟下这些 AC 只能靠 sleep 变 flaky，或退化成恒真的假通过。须在 M1 的 T-003、contracts/host、check-seams 一次定死：ctx.now() 从可变值读取、暴露 ctx.clock.advance(ms)/setNow(t)、所有生产模块只经 ctx.now() 取时（check-seams 已禁裸 Date.now/new Date 于 context.mjs 之外）。\"\r [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":30,"content":"      \"text\": \"确认 TB-6：冻结注册表的权威 oracle 仍只存在于 .collab/blueprint/cliworker-v2/（interfaces.md【1】..【15】节、designer.log/state.json 的 B.4.4 金标、review-v1.verdict.json、task-graph.json）。已核实这些文件确在该目录，但 .gitignore 无 .collab/ 规则、package.json 的 files 白名单为 [lib,cordis.patch.yml,dsh.plugin.json,README.md] 不含 .collab/，且 AC-025 明确要求 npm pack 不含 .collab/——即权威规格既不随包发布、也未声明为版本化随仓库提交的机读产物。T-004 输入是『interfaces 第 1～15 节』，AC-016 标 B.4.4，AC-010/AC-015 唯一预期值与 AC-067 的 semantic_change 清单都从这些节推导；干净 CI checkout 无此目录时，冻结/比较/金标/迁移文档测试缺稳定真源。contracts/registry.snapshot.json 只登记码与枚举，并非公式、阈值表、B.4.4 金标与 draft→v1 映射的真源。须在 M1 前把权威规格提升为 contracts/ 下版本化、提交、机读的 artifacts（并入 T-004 输出的 docs/contract.md），令 registry.snapshot.json 自包含、运行时不读 .collab/，并明确 AC-015/016/017/051 各金标对应哪个仓库内文件。\"\r [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]}],"totalLines":24,"totalMatchedLines":24,"clientTruncated":false,"ripgrepTruncated":false}}}}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-9a2f85c1-3469-4553-a12b-56c543087da8-23\nfc_f2c4390b-c627-951f-9de0-3e41948448f7_3","startedAtMs":"1794076225719","completedAtMs":"1794076226229"},"model_call_id":"6eee2667-625b-41c4-b449-c94ee3fbbfde-6-6ri8","session_id":"8b0c7e00-33b7-4132-af53-4d244a6a9e2f","timestamp_ms":1794076226380}
