le":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/tasks/003/review-r2.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":21,"content":"实现只变了一处：`lib/index.js:38`，`const s = settings || {}` 改为 `const s = { readonly: false, ...(settings || {}) }`。design.md §6（第 192 行）要求 `settings` 取 `configPath`、`readonly`（缺省 false）、`strict`（缺省 false），这一行补上了 `readonly` 缺省值。`readonly` 不参与任何注册行为，所以路由注册、HTTP 输出与 `getRegistration()` 结构都不变。`strict` 仍由 `apply` 里的 `settings || {}` 读取（`lib/index.js:101-103`），不受影响。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":42,"content":"- V-R-5：无法用 git 确认；按文件清单对照 `write_scope`，dev 本轮只改了 `lib/index.js`（在 `write_scope` 内）。字面例外仍是 `test/unit/traceability.test.mjs`（编排方 `c4cc757` 所改，见 P2-1）。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":48,"content":"- 位置：`acceptance.md` V-R-5 `globs`、`design.md` `write_scope`","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":49,"content":"- 现象：该文件相对基准有改动，两份规格都没有列它，字面运行 V-R-5 会报 `outside write_scope`。改动出自编排方对已记录死锁的处置，不是 dev 越界。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":50,"content":"- 建议：编排方补进 `write_scope` 与 V-R-5 `globs`，或在合并说明里记录该例外。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"/mnt/c/git/dsh-CLIWorker/.collab/tasks/003/impl.md","matches":[{"lineNumber":3,"content":"实施范围严格按 `design.md` 的 `write_scope`：只新建/修改了 design 列出的文件，未改动 `brief.md`、`design.md`、`acceptance.md`、`lib/select.mjs`、`scripts/` 下的既有脚本，也未执行任何 git 命令。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":91,"content":"- brief 与 design 的 `write_scope` 不含 `test/unit/traceability.test.mjs`；","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":92,"content":"- acceptance 的 V-R-5 会把任何 `write_scope` 之外的文件变化判为失败。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":94,"content":"建议的处置（需要在 `write_scope` 之外改动，应由该文件所属任务或裁决方执行）：把第 158 行改成 `assert.equal(merged.acs['AC-006'], 'covered')`（或改成断言一个仍然没有 shard 的 AC，例如 `AC-009`）。除此之外 `check-fast` 其余步骤全绿。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":147,"content":"### 6.3 为什么本轮不在 `write_scope` 之外修这一行","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":157,"content":"- 改 `test/unit/traceability.test.mjs:158` 为 `'covered'`，或改断言一个仍无分片的 AC（如 `AC-009`，语义上更贴合该测试标题）。**副作用**：该文件不在 V-R-5 的 globs 内，V-R-5 的 `scope` 探针会把它判为 `outside write_scope`，V-R-5 转红。因此这一改动必须与 `write_scope` 和 V-R-5 globs 的同步扩充一起做（即第 1 轮评审 P1 建议的 (a)）。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":161,"content":"在没有 `write_scope` / V-R-5 globs 扩充的前提下，任何一侧修复都只是把失败项从一个验收条目搬到另一个，总判定仍是 `needs_revision`。因此本轮保持仓库现状：实现与 20/21 条探针全绿，唯一红项的证据就是上面这段输出。","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":163,"content":"**请求的裁决**（二者取一，均需改 `design.md`/`acceptance.md`，非本角色权限）：","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false},{"lineNumber":165,"content":"- (a) `write_scope` 增加 `test/unit/traceability.test.mjs`，同时 V-R-5 的 `globs` 增加 `'test/unit/traceability.test.mjs'`，并把第 158 行改为 `assert.equal(merged.acs['AC-006'], 'covered')`（推荐改断言 `AC-009` 以保留该测试的原意）；","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]}],"totalLines":325,"totalMatchedLines":325,"clientTruncated":true,"ripgrepTruncated":false,"headLimitApplied":60}}}}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-29046a65-ba65-4cbf-a9eb-1addba386098-24\nfc_19ef8cc1-b265-9a1d-a81e-370c3e6b613a_0","startedAtMs":"1794076237196","completedAtMs":"1794076237921"},"model_call_id":"6eee2667-625b-41c4-b449-c94ee3fbbfde-7-0t6z","session_id":"8b0c7e00-33b7-4132-af53-4d244a6a9e2f","timestamp_ms":1794076238096}
